  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the dolsot stone bowl over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped pecan nuts and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the vegetable broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
